WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.014
Jimbo, I need targets!


00:01:08.102 --> 00:01:09.102
Shit.


00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.330
Hey! Move it, buddy.
You're blocking the door.


00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.714
Sorry. Reflex.


00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:39.592
What the hell's wrong with you?


00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.801
Have a nice day.


00:01:53.897 --> 00:01:55.690
Get off me! You have to run!


00:01:56.191 --> 00:01:59.194
The world will end in a flash
of light and you'll be gone!


00:01:59.903 --> 00:02:02.322
You'll all be gone,
just like the others!


00:02:04.365 --> 00:02:06.200
We told you to leave this alley!


00:02:08.869 --> 00:02:11.163
And now, you pay the price.


00:02:23.718 --> 00:02:24.886
Stop!


00:02:25.762 --> 00:02:28.014
You want to play bodyguard
for this garbage?


00:02:37.314 --> 00:02:38.607
I guess I do.


00:02:42.778 --> 00:02:44.238
Then you're a dead man, too!


00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.407
We're all dead! Everyone's dead!


00:02:47.491 --> 00:02:49.117
Dead, dead, dead...


00:03:24.277 --> 00:03:25.903
Police! Freeze!


00:03:36.581 --> 00:03:39.083
You can't just go beating the
crap out of people, soldier.


00:03:42.169 --> 00:03:43.671
We got a public disturbance.


00:03:43.754 --> 00:03:45.547
Name's Stewart, John.


00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:47.358
- Looks like he might be a vet...
- Where'd you do your tour?


00:03:47.382 --> 00:03:48.508
Afghanistan?


00:03:50.093 --> 00:03:52.095
I was in Iraq. That sucked, too.


00:03:55.515 --> 00:03:56.766
Mike, come here...


00:03:59.228 --> 00:04:01.105
You're not going
to believe this,


00:04:01.606 --> 00:04:03.274
but this guy's a
Medal of Honor winner.


00:04:03.858 --> 00:04:05.610
Citation list a mile long.


00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:09.614
Do we really want to risk getting
heat from social media or the press?


00:04:12.282 --> 00:04:13.700
Go home, Mr. Stewart.


00:04:14.492 --> 00:04:15.660
Stay out of trouble.


00:04:48.985 --> 00:04:51.571
At last. There you are.


00:05:23.894 --> 00:05:25.104
What the hell?


00:06:10.857 --> 00:06:15.737
I found you at
last, John Stewart.


00:06:19.406 --> 00:06:21.324
Who are you? How do you know me?


00:06:24.578 --> 00:06:27.664
You must... You must...


00:06:27.748 --> 00:06:30.251
Lay still. I'm gonna
take you to the hospital.


00:07:01.406 --> 00:07:02.866
Poor bastard.


00:07:13.292 --> 00:07:14.877
<i>John Stewart of Earth!</i>


00:07:17.296 --> 00:07:18.714
Who? What?


00:07:19.508 --> 00:07:21.468
<i>You possess singular will.</i>


00:07:21.551 --> 00:07:23.845
<i>Welcome to the
Green Lantern Corps.</i>


00:07:40.528 --> 00:07:42.613
Get off of me!


00:07:45.825 --> 00:07:47.409
And what the hell is this now?


00:07:47.952 --> 00:07:50.663
<i>That is your Green
Lantern Corps uniform,</i>


00:07:50.746 --> 00:07:52.248
<i>Green Lantern John Stewart.</i>


00:07:52.748 --> 00:07:54.291
<i>Alterations can be made.</i>


00:07:54.375 --> 00:07:57.377
No, no, no... I am
not hearing this!


00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.837
<i>Green Lantern John Stewart...</i>


00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:00.296
Stop calling me that!


00:08:01.005 --> 00:08:02.757
Okay, great! Now
I'm talking to it!


00:08:02.841 --> 00:08:06.177
<i>Contacting Green Lantern
headquarters on Oa for guidance.</i>


00:08:06.261 --> 00:08:08.680
Right. You do that,
and I'll do this.


00:08:09.849 --> 00:08:11.392
<i>Contact unsuccessful.</i>


00:08:11.851 --> 00:08:14.937
<i>You are tasked with halting
five genocides in this sector.</i>


00:08:15.354 --> 00:08:17.523
<i>Then you must stop
the Baelishian War...</i>


00:08:17.606 --> 00:08:19.066
Pound sand, ring!


00:08:32.871 --> 00:08:35.623
I'm taking all the damn meds
the VA prescribes from now on.


00:08:36.124 --> 00:08:38.960
And you are getting
off my finger!


00:08:39.377 --> 00:08:41.045
Dammit! Why won't you come off?


00:08:41.129 --> 00:08:44.132
<i>Standard ring
programming superseded.</i>


00:08:44.382 --> 00:08:46.384
Okay. Okay, okay.
Let's just calm down.


00:08:47.801 --> 00:08:50.804
Is there someone who would know
what to do in this situation?


00:08:51.305 --> 00:08:52.431
Someone I can talk to?


00:08:52.514 --> 00:08:53.432
<i>Affirmative.</i>


00:08:53.515 --> 00:08:54.933
Can you show them to me?


00:09:06.404 --> 00:09:07.739
Stop! Stop!


00:09:08.907 --> 00:09:09.907
You're gonna kill me!


00:09:10.783 --> 00:09:13.744
<i>Are you addressing me,
Green Lantern John Stewart?</i>


00:09:14.161 --> 00:09:16.413
Who the hell else
would I be talking to?


00:09:17.164 --> 00:09:18.790
<i>To avoid future confusion,</i>


00:09:19.583 --> 00:09:22.836
<i>consider addressing
me as "Ring."</i>


00:09:29.551 --> 00:09:30.761
What's that up ahead?


00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:35.182
I mean... Ring, what
is that up ahead?


00:09:35.933 --> 00:09:38.935
<i>It is called the Justice
League Watchtower.</i>


00:10:04.502 --> 00:10:06.379
All right guys, I have no idea


00:10:06.462 --> 00:10:08.673
what's going on out in
galactic sector 814,


00:10:08.756 --> 00:10:11.634
but it is definitely big and
the disruption is spreading.


00:10:11.717 --> 00:10:13.052
It could even reach Earth.


00:10:17.139 --> 00:10:18.891
We need all hands on deck.


00:10:18.975 --> 00:10:22.395
Superman and Wonder Woman
should be back within a week.


00:10:22.478 --> 00:10:24.814
Perhaps they will
have answers for us.


00:10:24.897 --> 00:10:27.177
It's too bad Batman's pulled
one of his disappearing acts.


00:10:27.983 --> 00:10:29.901
We're stretched
too thin as it is.


00:10:41.414 --> 00:10:42.414
Hey.


00:10:43.332 --> 00:10:44.332
Intruder!


00:10:45.126 --> 00:10:46.252
Alpha Defense Pattern!


00:10:49.922 --> 00:10:51.007
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!


00:10:53.341 --> 00:10:54.341
Back off!


00:11:50.147 --> 00:11:51.398
I have pointy ones, too.


00:11:51.482 --> 00:11:53.567
Green Arrow, wait... look.


00:11:56.737 --> 00:11:58.822
Are you a Green Lantern?


00:11:58.906 --> 00:12:01.408
That would explain why he
didn't set off any alarms.


00:12:02.326 --> 00:12:03.660
I'm not here to fight.


00:12:03.744 --> 00:12:05.788
I just want to get
rid of this thing.


00:12:07.705 --> 00:12:09.749
It is a Lantern Power Ring.


00:12:09.832 --> 00:12:12.835
The Guardians didn't say anything
about sending a new Green Lantern.


00:12:12.919 --> 00:12:16.005
Well, the Guardians haven't
said squat to us in like a year.


00:12:16.839 --> 00:12:19.801
Power Ring, who was
your previous owner?


00:12:21.178 --> 00:12:23.097
<i>Green Lantern Hal Jordan.</i>


00:12:24.723 --> 00:12:26.934
Hal Jordan... is dead?


00:12:27.017 --> 00:12:28.977
Who are you? How did you
get our friend's ring?


00:12:31.438 --> 00:12:33.189
My name is John Stewart


00:12:33.272 --> 00:12:35.775
and if I told you, you
wouldn't believe me.


00:12:41.239 --> 00:12:43.783
Try us. We are the
Justice League.


00:12:45.118 --> 00:12:46.661
We have seen a lot.


00:12:46.744 --> 00:12:47.745
Seriously.


00:12:48.496 --> 00:12:49.580
A lot.


00:12:51.749 --> 00:12:53.584
A burning space
ship crashed by me.


00:12:54.293 --> 00:12:55.795
I ran over to help and found,


00:12:55.878 --> 00:12:57.796
swear to God, a
little blue alien.


00:12:57.879 --> 00:13:00.132
And, he turned to dust.


00:13:00.215 --> 00:13:03.385
Then this talking
ring flew on my finger


00:13:03.468 --> 00:13:04.928
and now it won't come off.


00:13:13.229 --> 00:13:15.231
Why would a Guardian
come to Earth


00:13:15.314 --> 00:13:16.816
to deliver a Power Ring?


00:13:16.899 --> 00:13:18.901
He's lying, that's
why. Hal's not dead.


00:13:18.985 --> 00:13:20.695
This guy is trying to trick us.


00:13:21.154 --> 00:13:23.155
Power Rings are
like my Tantu Totem.


00:13:23.238 --> 00:13:26.366
They're not easily wielded
by someone unworthy.


00:13:26.449 --> 00:13:29.286
Okay did you see how much
he sucked at using it?


00:13:31.371 --> 00:13:34.666
Perhaps this is connected to
those disturbances in deep space.


00:13:34.749 --> 00:13:37.085
Maybe we should go find out
what's going on out there.


00:13:37.169 --> 00:13:39.171
We cannot leave
Earth unprotected.


00:13:39.254 --> 00:13:41.423
And since the Flash
is also on a mission,


00:13:41.506 --> 00:13:45.510
I am the only one qualified to
administrate the Watchtower.


00:13:45.594 --> 00:13:48.512
I'll go. I got to get to the
truth of what happened to Hal.


00:13:48.596 --> 00:13:50.431
You should take him with you.


00:13:50.514 --> 00:13:51.849
No way. Hard pass.


00:13:51.932 --> 00:13:54.310
Hard, hard pass. I don't
trust this guy one bit.


00:13:54.393 --> 00:13:56.020
He seems totally sketchy.


00:13:56.103 --> 00:13:58.647
You do realize I
can hear you, right?


00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.211
Look, I'll check out
the crashed ship.


00:14:01.276 --> 00:14:03.528
If it still flies,
I'll autopilot to Oa.


00:14:03.612 --> 00:14:05.132
I'll get right in
the Guardians faces.


00:14:06.823 --> 00:14:08.366
I'm sure they'll love that.


00:14:09.367 --> 00:14:11.620
And if something has happened
to Hal, then we'll know.


00:14:11.703 --> 00:14:13.454
But he stays here.


00:14:14.163 --> 00:14:17.791
Uh, question, can any of
you get this ring off me?


00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.379
I have witnessed Green
Lanterns take their rings off,


00:14:22.796 --> 00:14:25.424
so it should be
possible, unless...


00:14:25.883 --> 00:14:28.260
The ring's programming
was changed?


00:14:28.344 --> 00:14:29.344
Yes.


00:14:29.929 --> 00:14:32.056
But these Guardians,
they could get it off?


00:14:32.681 --> 00:14:34.725
They did create the Power Rings.


00:14:39.812 --> 00:14:41.814
Then I'm going to this
"Oa" place with you.


00:14:41.898 --> 00:14:43.983
You got a problem with
that, talk to the hand.


00:14:45.652 --> 00:14:47.570
You know, the one
with the ring on it.


00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.252
Hey! Watch it! Slow down!


00:15:05.129 --> 00:15:08.007
Terrible. On, like, all fronts.


00:15:10.593 --> 00:15:12.512
This was a burning
wreck when I left it.


00:15:13.554 --> 00:15:14.764
Now, it's like new.


00:15:16.474 --> 00:15:19.477
Mm, yeah, it probably has some kind
of sophisticated self-repair program,


00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.937
like nanites and what have you.


00:15:27.527 --> 00:15:29.278
You seem to know
your way around.


00:15:29.361 --> 00:15:31.839
Actually, I've never seen it
before. But Hal once explained to me


00:15:31.863 --> 00:15:34.366
that the real measure of
any advanced technology


00:15:34.449 --> 00:15:36.285
is how intuitive it is to use.


00:15:46.504 --> 00:15:48.214
You think you can
fly this thing to Oa?


00:15:48.298 --> 00:15:50.216
I... am not sure. Probably.


00:15:53.052 --> 00:15:54.051
But...


00:15:54.803 --> 00:15:55.803
But what?


00:15:57.389 --> 00:15:58.515
We need coordinates.


00:16:02.936 --> 00:16:03.936
Talk to your Ring.


00:16:04.229 --> 00:16:05.355
What do you mean?


00:16:05.689 --> 00:16:07.482
Well, just ask it
for directions to Oa.


00:16:07.566 --> 00:16:08.710
In fact, just tell
it to put them


00:16:08.734 --> 00:16:10.527
into the ship's autopilot
and get us moving.


00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.948
Ring, did you hear all
that? Can you do it?


00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:17.034
<i>Unlocking systems.</i>


00:16:17.117 --> 00:16:18.201
<i>Integrating.</i>


00:16:18.576 --> 00:16:19.910
<i>Coordinates set.</i>


00:16:25.333 --> 00:16:27.585
Um, let's go?


00:16:47.188 --> 00:16:49.607
<i>The Guardians were among
the first intelligent</i>


00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.400
<i>forms of life in the universe.</i>


00:16:51.484 --> 00:16:54.195
<i>When they perceived that
less evolved life forms</i>


00:16:54.278 --> 00:16:56.697
<i>were often prone to
chaos and violence,</i>


00:16:56.781 --> 00:17:00.701
<i>they decided a police force
was necessary to keep order.</i>


00:17:01.452 --> 00:17:04.205
<i>These they called
Green Lanterns,</i>


00:17:05.289 --> 00:17:06.874
<i>and their members were selected</i>


00:17:06.957 --> 00:17:09.501
<i>amongst the alien races
for their intelligence,</i>


00:17:10.585 --> 00:17:11.585
<i>willpower</i>


00:17:12.504 --> 00:17:13.713
<i>and fearlessness.</i>


00:17:15.507 --> 00:17:16.508
Huh?


00:17:21.555 --> 00:17:23.307
Hey, look alive,
rookie. We're here.


00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:30.731
So the Guardians are a prickly
bunch that don't much like humans.


00:17:32.316 --> 00:17:34.692
- Because they've met you?
- That's good, but no.


00:17:34.776 --> 00:17:36.903
Because, they think we're
too stupid to waste time on.


00:17:36.986 --> 00:17:38.655
Please, don't prove them right.


00:17:57.507 --> 00:18:00.759
Okay, so this is why they
haven't returned our calls.


00:18:42.551 --> 00:18:43.551
You okay?


00:18:45.387 --> 00:18:46.387
Yeah.


00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.392
Everything here is built
around that building,


00:18:53.978 --> 00:18:55.480
like it's important
or something.


00:18:57.398 --> 00:18:59.233
Maybe we'll find
some answers there.


00:19:00.985 --> 00:19:03.739
Good. Nice to see
you're not useless.


00:19:16.334 --> 00:19:17.752
I know this one.


00:19:17.835 --> 00:19:18.835
Sinestro.


00:19:19.295 --> 00:19:22.006
He trained Hal into becoming
the greatest Green Lantern ever.


00:19:23.716 --> 00:19:24.759
What happened to him?


00:19:24.842 --> 00:19:26.594
He turned into an evil psycho.


00:19:27.261 --> 00:19:29.889
I'm guessing they left that part
out when they gave the tour.


00:19:30.348 --> 00:19:32.350
But, again, he trained Hal.


00:19:34.185 --> 00:19:36.979
Look, it's not like I
haven't heard of Hal Jordan.


00:19:37.063 --> 00:19:38.439
And yeah, he's pretty great,


00:19:38.523 --> 00:19:41.441
but so were all these
other Lanterns. Right?


00:19:45.111 --> 00:19:46.613
Holy crap!


00:19:51.953 --> 00:19:54.121
<i>Hal Jordan is acknowledged to be</i>


00:19:54.205 --> 00:19:57.291
<i>the greatest Green
Lantern in the universe.</i>


00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.628
In the universe?


00:20:01.295 --> 00:20:02.588
Look what I found.


00:20:03.548 --> 00:20:04.881
Ammo box, huh?


00:20:04.965 --> 00:20:07.717
Correct. This is what Lanterns
use to recharge their Rings.


00:20:07.801 --> 00:20:08.802
You'll need one.


00:20:11.137 --> 00:20:13.306
I'm here to get rid of
this thing, remember?


00:20:14.182 --> 00:20:15.475
Better to be prepared.


00:20:15.559 --> 00:20:18.562
I'm going to see what else I can
find. Just stay out of trouble, hero.


00:20:29.363 --> 00:20:31.657
Well, uh... that's something.


00:20:44.254 --> 00:20:45.505
Well, all right.


00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:25.668
Can't I leave you
alone for one second?


00:21:51.152 --> 00:21:53.237
<i>Lethal force is not authorized.</i>


00:21:55.156 --> 00:21:57.033
<i>Lethal force is not authorized.</i>


00:21:59.369 --> 00:22:01.454
<i>Lethal force is not authorized.</i>


00:22:02.455 --> 00:22:04.540
<i>Lethal force is not authorized.</i>


00:22:06.793 --> 00:22:08.002
<i>Lethal force is not...</i>


00:22:08.086 --> 00:22:09.086
You're killing her!


00:22:12.339 --> 00:22:13.632
Stop!


00:22:21.056 --> 00:22:23.184
You should have finished me.


00:22:24.352 --> 00:22:27.438
Why? We're trying to find
out what happened here.


00:22:29.691 --> 00:22:32.110
You weren't part of
the Rannian attack?


00:22:32.193 --> 00:22:34.611
Rannians? No no.
We just got here.


00:22:34.695 --> 00:22:36.822
I'm Green Arrow. His
name's John Stewart.


00:22:37.531 --> 00:22:38.531
Who are you?


00:22:39.825 --> 00:22:44.121
I am Shayera Hol, warrior
of Thanagar, First Order.


00:22:44.913 --> 00:22:47.082
Okay, well, let's
make a deal, Shayera.


00:22:47.207 --> 00:22:49.793
No one kills anyone
for at least a minute


00:22:49.876 --> 00:22:52.129
and instead we
exchange some info.


00:22:54.965 --> 00:22:56.258
These are the last images


00:22:56.341 --> 00:22:58.719
before the Oan security
net was disabled.


00:22:59.553 --> 00:23:01.137
A Rannian ship.


00:23:01.220 --> 00:23:03.556
It must have carried
one of their kill squads


00:23:03.639 --> 00:23:05.891
instead of the diplomats
listed in the logs.


00:23:06.934 --> 00:23:07.934
Maybe.


00:23:10.146 --> 00:23:12.232
The evidence is in front of you.


00:23:12.315 --> 00:23:14.568
Look, John and I don't
see eye to eye on a lot,


00:23:14.651 --> 00:23:18.071
but he's right, we don't
know who was in that ship.


00:23:18.155 --> 00:23:19.740
And why are you here?


00:23:19.823 --> 00:23:21.908
He's just asking, not accusing.


00:23:22.659 --> 00:23:24.827
My ship was destroyed in battle.


00:23:24.910 --> 00:23:27.037
I came to seek aid
from the Guardians


00:23:27.121 --> 00:23:29.165
in our war against the
honor less Rannians


00:23:29.248 --> 00:23:30.291
but was too late.


00:23:35.087 --> 00:23:36.505
They will pay.


00:23:38.257 --> 00:23:39.550
If you're seeking vengeance,


00:23:39.633 --> 00:23:41.844
shouldn't you be sure you
have the right target?


00:23:43.679 --> 00:23:45.681
You don't understand, do you?


00:23:51.936 --> 00:23:56.775
<i>After years of bloody war, we
finally achieved the tenuous peace.</i>


00:23:58.777 --> 00:23:59.944
<i>To codify it,</i>


00:24:00.028 --> 00:24:03.032
<i>Thanagar and Rann agreed
to a joint project</i>


00:24:03.115 --> 00:24:05.367
<i>led by Sardath and Banth Dar.</i>


00:24:06.869 --> 00:24:09.872
<i>Zeta-Beam technology would be
harnessed to create a bridge</i>


00:24:09.955 --> 00:24:13.375
<i>between our worlds and
boost both of our economies.</i>


00:24:15.502 --> 00:24:18.004
Banth, begin the
power up sequence!


00:24:45.197 --> 00:24:47.658
<i>Initially, the project
was a great success.</i>


00:25:08.762 --> 00:25:11.849
Green Lantern to command center.
Are you doing another test?


00:25:40.710 --> 00:25:43.422
I can't stop the emitter from
firing! We're locked out!


00:25:46.133 --> 00:25:48.510
<i>Green Lantern, something
has gone wrong!</i>


00:25:48.594 --> 00:25:49.970
What was your first clue?


00:25:50.596 --> 00:25:53.223
<i>You must stop the
platform from firing!</i>


00:25:55.100 --> 00:25:56.434
I'll try plugging it!


00:26:31.927 --> 00:26:34.847
<i>The Zeta force transported
the entire planet of Thanagar</i>


00:26:34.931 --> 00:26:39.185
<i>into Rannian space, upsetting
the ecosystem of both planets.</i>


00:26:39.936 --> 00:26:43.356
Hal Jordan and millions of
Thanagarians died that day.


00:26:43.439 --> 00:26:45.857
And the war criminal
Sardath escaped.


00:26:46.524 --> 00:26:48.360
How do you know it
wasn't an accident?


00:26:48.443 --> 00:26:50.278
And this ship doesn't
prove anything.


00:26:51.446 --> 00:26:54.282
A true warrior does
not ask questions.


00:26:54.366 --> 00:26:56.034
They do not hesitate.


00:26:56.117 --> 00:26:57.369
They kill.


00:26:59.037 --> 00:27:01.456
Kinda seems to me we should
talk to the Rannians.


00:27:01.539 --> 00:27:04.459
The nearest outpost
is light years away.


00:27:04.542 --> 00:27:05.627
We have a ship.


00:27:05.710 --> 00:27:08.672
If you promise not to
attack us, you can come.


00:27:11.298 --> 00:27:14.134
I shall accompany you
and I will not attack.


00:27:14.218 --> 00:27:18.722
Unless threatened, insulted,
or menaced. Then, you die.


00:27:23.812 --> 00:27:25.063
Well, she's fun.


00:27:38.158 --> 00:27:39.159
What's this now?


00:27:39.243 --> 00:27:41.412
I discovered the Ring
comes with a manual.


00:27:41.495 --> 00:27:44.248
This exercise is part of
Green Lantern Corps training.


00:27:44.331 --> 00:27:45.332
It's like a video game.


00:27:46.834 --> 00:27:49.920
The kind of trouble we're
headed into is not a game.


00:27:50.004 --> 00:27:52.089
You said you can get
that Ring off right?


00:27:52.172 --> 00:27:54.675
Yeah. Seems I can now.


00:27:54.758 --> 00:27:56.927
I thought you wanted
to get rid of it?


00:27:57.011 --> 00:27:58.012
I do.


00:27:58.095 --> 00:28:00.597
But you both need me to make
the ship go to someplace


00:28:00.681 --> 00:28:01.960
where there might be shooting...


00:28:03.558 --> 00:28:05.268
Well, yeah. I mean probably.


00:28:06.019 --> 00:28:08.813
More than likely. Almost
definitely, actually.


00:28:09.939 --> 00:28:12.608
So, until we can give this
Ring back to your friend,


00:28:12.692 --> 00:28:14.862
it's better to be
prepared, right?


00:28:17.156 --> 00:28:19.158
<i>Ring at three percent power.</i>


00:28:21.368 --> 00:28:24.288
- Come on. Just when I think I...
- You have to recharge it.


00:28:24.955 --> 00:28:25.954
Where's the battery?


00:28:35.131 --> 00:28:36.299
Stick your hand in it.


00:28:40.887 --> 00:28:42.722
It's not doing anything.


00:28:42.805 --> 00:28:44.057
You gotta say the oath.


00:28:44.140 --> 00:28:45.975
Oath? What oath?


00:28:46.642 --> 00:28:48.478
Yeah. Repeat after me...


00:28:49.145 --> 00:28:51.313
"In brightest day,
in blackest night,


00:28:51.396 --> 00:28:53.148
no evil shall escape my sight.


00:28:53.231 --> 00:28:55.150
Let those who
worship evil's might,


00:28:55.233 --> 00:28:57.486
beware my power...
Green Lantern's light."


00:28:58.236 --> 00:28:59.571
You're kidding, right?


00:28:59.654 --> 00:29:02.324
No, I am not. Say it
out loud and proud.


00:29:05.495 --> 00:29:07.497
"In brightest day,
in blackest night,


00:29:07.580 --> 00:29:09.749
no evil shall escape my sight.


00:29:09.832 --> 00:29:11.834
Let those who
worship evil's might,


00:29:11.918 --> 00:29:14.253
beware my power...
Green Lantern's light."


00:29:28.934 --> 00:29:31.103
<i>Ring at 100 percent power.</i>


00:29:31.186 --> 00:29:34.022
Of all the hokey,
lame-ass things...


00:30:09.557 --> 00:30:13.227
The Rannian scum have murdered the
Thanagarians sent to destroy them.


00:30:13.352 --> 00:30:15.771
Mmm-hmm. You hear
yourself, right?


00:30:35.373 --> 00:30:36.373
Move!


00:31:06.779 --> 00:31:09.657
Okay, everyone take a moment
and remember our manners.


00:31:13.328 --> 00:31:14.329
Aw, crap.


00:31:41.648 --> 00:31:43.399
Does everyone here want
to kill each other?


00:32:06.338 --> 00:32:08.966
Think! We need to question him.


00:32:12.343 --> 00:32:15.680
Of course, interrogation first.


00:32:16.639 --> 00:32:18.182
Then, execution.


00:32:30.821 --> 00:32:34.283
I don't fear death.
Get on with it.


00:32:35.534 --> 00:32:39.453
We had nothing to do with this.
And we don't want to kill you.


00:32:40.621 --> 00:32:43.040
Just answer our
questions, please.


00:32:44.208 --> 00:32:46.210
This is pointless.


00:32:46.294 --> 00:32:48.504
What can he tell us
that is of any value?


00:32:48.587 --> 00:32:50.589
Maybe give him a
second to answer?


00:32:50.673 --> 00:32:53.175
What was that bright light
that brought you here?


00:32:55.136 --> 00:32:57.555
He's a Green Lantern.
Aren't they allies of yours?


00:33:00.641 --> 00:33:03.977
They were until his people
Killed the Guardians.


00:33:06.104 --> 00:33:08.231
The Guardians are dead? How?


00:33:08.898 --> 00:33:10.066
First thing's first.


00:33:10.150 --> 00:33:11.151
The bright light.


00:33:13.153 --> 00:33:14.488
It was a Zeta-Beam.


00:33:15.156 --> 00:33:18.075
They seem attracted to
me. I don't know why.


00:33:18.159 --> 00:33:19.952
But when they hit,
they transport me


00:33:20.036 --> 00:33:22.413
to different, far-reaching
parts of the galaxy.


00:33:22.496 --> 00:33:24.415
I have little control over them.


00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:28.335
Fairy tales and lies
can't undo the fact


00:33:28.418 --> 00:33:32.714
that Rann destroyed Oa and
murdered the Green Lanterns.


00:33:33.506 --> 00:33:36.509
No. Rann is allied
with the Guardians.


00:33:36.593 --> 00:33:39.179
The Green Lanterns are
heroes to the Rannians.


00:33:39.262 --> 00:33:41.681
If I can get to High
Command, I'll show you.


00:33:43.433 --> 00:33:45.643
The only thing this
man could show us


00:33:45.727 --> 00:33:47.854
is the fastest way to
the bottom of a bottle.


00:33:49.147 --> 00:33:50.857
I know how I look.


00:33:50.940 --> 00:33:52.858
But I'm Adam Strange.


00:33:54.151 --> 00:33:56.612
You? You're the Night Flyer?


00:33:56.695 --> 00:33:59.948
The Bane of the
Wingmen? Not likely.


00:34:00.032 --> 00:34:03.285
Adam Strange is
dead, gone years ago.


00:34:03.952 --> 00:34:06.706
Gone, yes. Dead, no.


00:34:06.790 --> 00:34:10.293
A Zeta-Beam took me and I couldn't
figure out how to get back.


00:34:10.377 --> 00:34:11.961
So, how are you here now?


00:34:12.545 --> 00:34:15.882
Random chance. Zeta-Beams
are unpredictable.


00:34:16.883 --> 00:34:19.134
As are Rannian cutthroats.


00:34:20.552 --> 00:34:21.720
Listen to me.


00:34:21.804 --> 00:34:24.223
Rannians would never attack Oa.


00:34:25.474 --> 00:34:26.475
Okay, then.


00:34:26.558 --> 00:34:28.894
Let's go to your High Command
and see if you're right.


00:34:31.897 --> 00:34:34.691
Our answers will
be found on Rann.


00:34:34.775 --> 00:34:37.069
And so will my vengeance.


00:34:37.820 --> 00:34:40.781
Great road trip crew
you've assembled, John.


00:34:40.864 --> 00:34:42.116
Try not to get murdered.


00:35:00.759 --> 00:35:01.927
<i>Test complete.</i>


00:35:04.513 --> 00:35:07.015
<i>For a Bering that does not
want to be a Green Lantern,</i>


00:35:07.099 --> 00:35:08.766
<i>you show some ability.</i>


00:35:08.850 --> 00:35:10.685
Just passing the time.


00:35:52.810 --> 00:35:55.897
What was it that caused the
war between Thanagar and Rann?


00:35:55.980 --> 00:35:57.731
Rannian treachery, of course.


00:35:57.814 --> 00:36:01.985
Under a guise of a peaceful
experiment meant to benefit everyone,


00:36:02.068 --> 00:36:05.655
they transported their planet
into our system to conquer it.


00:36:05.739 --> 00:36:07.908
What do you mean
Thanagar transported?


00:36:07.991 --> 00:36:11.536
You attacked our capital
city first and destroyed it!


00:36:11.620 --> 00:36:15.332
That was the war you were
involved in years ago. Many died.


00:36:15.415 --> 00:36:18.251
Since you've been gone,
it finally ended in peace.


00:36:18.335 --> 00:36:22.796
And as a gesture of hope and
goodwill, we became allies.


00:36:22.880 --> 00:36:24.840
Until your leaders tricked us


00:36:24.924 --> 00:36:27.426
and tried to destroy
Thanagar for good!


00:36:35.519 --> 00:36:38.104
So, we should leave before
either side sees us.


00:36:38.188 --> 00:36:39.189
Not yet.


00:36:45.111 --> 00:36:46.530
It's just a derelict
being yanked


00:36:46.696 --> 00:36:48.614
into the gravitational
pull of a red dwarf.


00:36:49.365 --> 00:36:51.617
It appears our fighters
did their jobs well.


00:36:51.700 --> 00:36:52.701
Can you give it a rest?


00:36:52.785 --> 00:36:54.745
I may be able to access
the main computer


00:36:54.828 --> 00:36:56.205
with a scan of my DNA.


00:37:11.512 --> 00:37:13.888
Oh, yeah, they... they love you.


00:37:17.642 --> 00:37:20.812
<i>It seems the deities
have granted me my wish.</i>


00:37:22.814 --> 00:37:25.734
To have the pleasure of
killing one more Thanagarian.


00:37:27.194 --> 00:37:30.531
Wait! You are Kantus
of House Thrax.


00:37:30.614 --> 00:37:32.241
<i>A great and noble captain.</i>


00:37:32.992 --> 00:37:36.412
Am I so well known
to Thanagarian spies?


00:37:38.079 --> 00:37:40.164
It's me, Adam Strange.


00:37:41.749 --> 00:37:42.959
He's dead.


00:37:43.459 --> 00:37:45.503
Scan me and see the truth.


00:37:57.765 --> 00:37:59.934
We thought you died years ago.


00:38:00.768 --> 00:38:03.312
I've been away. Now I'm back.


00:38:04.104 --> 00:38:07.357
Then, the Thanagarian
is your prisoner?


00:38:07.441 --> 00:38:09.693
Prisoner? You Rannian...


00:38:09.776 --> 00:38:13.280
She's helping solve a mystery that
affects both Rann and Thanagar.


00:38:13.363 --> 00:38:17.327
But we need your help. Can we
tap into your ship's computers?


00:38:21.956 --> 00:38:24.459
<i>I've disengaged the firewalls.</i>


00:38:24.542 --> 00:38:26.669
<i>You're free to
scan our data bank.</i>


00:38:27.420 --> 00:38:31.548
Ring, download all relevant
information on the Rann-Thanagar war.


00:38:35.218 --> 00:38:37.971
I'd especially like to
know why Rann attacked Oa.


00:38:39.306 --> 00:38:42.392
What? Rann didn't attack Oa!


00:38:42.476 --> 00:38:45.437
You lie! We have evidence!


00:38:45.520 --> 00:38:48.315
<i>It's too late for
all your accusations.</i>


00:38:49.399 --> 00:38:53.653
<i>Soon all your kind will
be wiped out of existence.</i>


00:38:55.446 --> 00:38:57.031
What are you talking about?


00:38:57.114 --> 00:39:02.703
<i>Our greatest scientist is building
a weapon that will destroy Thanagar</i>


00:39:02.787 --> 00:39:05.666
<i>and end this war
once and for all.</i>


00:39:05.749 --> 00:39:08.168
Sardath. Where?


00:39:10.087 --> 00:39:12.172
Only a few key people know.


00:39:13.382 --> 00:39:15.258
I'm not one of them.


00:39:18.386 --> 00:39:20.346
This ship is doomed.


00:39:21.597 --> 00:39:26.102
As captain, I intend
to die with her.


00:39:26.185 --> 00:39:29.939
Ring, can you do anything to get
the battle cruiser moving again?


00:39:30.022 --> 00:39:33.025
<i>Rerouting power to the
kevval engines is possible.</i>


00:39:33.109 --> 00:39:36.654
<i>It may be enough to defeat the
gravitational pull of the red dwarf.</i>


00:39:36.737 --> 00:39:39.615
<i>Provided the hull survives
the forces required.</i>


00:39:40.116 --> 00:39:41.617
Re-route all power.


00:39:42.284 --> 00:39:43.702
Whatever you have to do.


00:39:45.203 --> 00:39:46.204
Do it!


00:40:18.903 --> 00:40:23.074
<i>Rannian battle cruiser has escaped
the red dwarf's gravitational pull.</i>


00:40:23.158 --> 00:40:25.076
Now he can limp his way home.


00:40:25.160 --> 00:40:26.494
<i>I don't believe so.</i>


00:40:27.579 --> 00:40:29.456
<i>Thank you Adam Strange.</i>


00:40:31.082 --> 00:40:32.917
<i>Onward for Rann!</i>


00:40:46.097 --> 00:40:47.682
He's going back to the battle!


00:40:48.516 --> 00:40:49.517
Idiot.


00:40:49.601 --> 00:40:52.687
His ship is useless.
What can he hope to do?


00:41:12.998 --> 00:41:16.543
A noble death in battle.
For everyone involved.


00:41:18.754 --> 00:41:20.088
Let's get out of here.


00:41:35.186 --> 00:41:37.648
Come over here.
We've made progress.


00:41:37.731 --> 00:41:41.568
Are you two actually in a room together
without tearing at each other's throats?


00:41:43.070 --> 00:41:45.322
Wow. Okay. Yes. Okay. All right.


00:41:46.073 --> 00:41:47.616
What have you found out?


00:41:47.699 --> 00:41:51.494
When the Zeta-Beam transported
Thanagar into Rann's atmosphere,


00:41:51.577 --> 00:41:53.871
it caused catastrophic
climate disasters.


00:42:04.966 --> 00:42:06.425
<i>The planet survived.</i>


00:42:06.509 --> 00:42:08.511
<i>And that's what started the war.</i>


00:42:11.514 --> 00:42:14.057
Now Sardath has
re-engineered the Zeta-Beam


00:42:14.140 --> 00:42:16.268
into a weapon of
total destruction.


00:42:17.894 --> 00:42:19.437
A planet destroyer.


00:42:21.273 --> 00:42:22.524
We've got to stop him.


00:42:22.607 --> 00:42:24.025
Any idea where they're based?


00:42:25.277 --> 00:42:26.696
Unfortunately, no.


00:42:26.779 --> 00:42:28.281
But we do have a lead.


00:42:28.364 --> 00:42:31.367
We were examining the
data on the attack on Oa.


00:42:31.450 --> 00:42:32.869
We discovered this.


00:42:44.671 --> 00:42:46.298
It's a Rannian ship.


00:42:46.381 --> 00:42:47.799
You were right.


00:42:47.883 --> 00:42:49.134
So I thought.


00:42:49.217 --> 00:42:53.013
But when we examined the drive
signature it left behind,


00:42:53.096 --> 00:42:54.890
something unusual turned up.


00:42:54.973 --> 00:42:57.767
We found an exact match.


00:42:59.978 --> 00:43:02.188
It was identical to
a ship that bombarded


00:43:02.272 --> 00:43:05.190
the United Galactic Council
Headquarters years ago,


00:43:05.274 --> 00:43:08.986
sabotaging the first peace talks
and killing several hundred people.


00:43:09.904 --> 00:43:12.239
But that was a Thanagarian ship.


00:43:12.323 --> 00:43:14.700
And that same ship's
signature was also found


00:43:14.783 --> 00:43:17.412
at the scene of many
more unwarranted attacks.


00:43:18.663 --> 00:43:22.083
Somebody is impersonating
both Rannians and Thanagarians


00:43:22.167 --> 00:43:23.710
to cause your war.


00:43:23.793 --> 00:43:25.420
It would seem so.


00:43:26.421 --> 00:43:29.465
Strange and I calculated the
direction the drive signatures left


00:43:29.548 --> 00:43:30.925
after many such attacks.


00:43:31.008 --> 00:43:34.178
In each case, the ship
headed in this direction.


00:43:35.554 --> 00:43:37.598
And if we triangulate
the escape routes,


00:43:37.681 --> 00:43:41.268
they all meet here,
in this sector.


00:43:42.019 --> 00:43:44.939
If we want answers, this
is where we find them.


00:43:58.576 --> 00:44:00.536
Maybe your calculations
were wrong?


00:44:00.620 --> 00:44:01.829
There's nothing here.


00:44:14.468 --> 00:44:15.928
Spoke too soon!


00:44:42.412 --> 00:44:43.830
I'm on the weapons!


00:44:51.169 --> 00:44:52.421
Nice shooting.


00:44:52.504 --> 00:44:56.008
Those guns are here to
protect something or somebody.


00:44:59.012 --> 00:45:00.596
Bingo. A shielded structure.


00:45:01.264 --> 00:45:02.515
I can't see what's inside.


00:45:03.433 --> 00:45:05.560
There's only one
way to find out.


00:45:31.293 --> 00:45:33.295
Artificial gravity and oxygen.


00:45:33.879 --> 00:45:35.963
Somebody went to
a lot of trouble


00:45:36.047 --> 00:45:38.466
to build a hideout
in this asteroid.


00:45:38.549 --> 00:45:42.720
Well, since they made it so
hospitable, let's go pay them a visit.


00:46:30.850 --> 00:46:34.104
What was that you were saying
about this place being hospitable?


00:48:11.324 --> 00:48:12.825
Do it! Kill him!


00:48:17.789 --> 00:48:18.789
No.


00:48:20.459 --> 00:48:21.877
I've had enough killing.


00:48:24.546 --> 00:48:27.382
How odd. When it
comes to killing,


00:48:27.466 --> 00:48:29.134
I can't get enough of it!


00:48:30.218 --> 00:48:31.260
Drop your weapons


00:48:31.344 --> 00:48:33.971
or this Green Lantern
becomes green slime.


00:48:40.811 --> 00:48:42.396
While we're on the subject.


00:48:46.234 --> 00:48:47.985
I think I'll
relieve you of this.


00:48:52.156 --> 00:48:53.950
With your lack of experience,


00:48:54.033 --> 00:48:56.993
you give new meaning to
the name "Green" Lantern.


00:48:58.495 --> 00:48:59.496
Lights out.


00:49:36.533 --> 00:49:37.533
John!


00:49:37.575 --> 00:49:40.036
I wouldn't try that again.


00:49:40.787 --> 00:49:43.623
Next time, you'll be
reduced to a pile of ash.


00:49:44.624 --> 00:49:46.083
You look familiar.


00:49:46.166 --> 00:49:47.710
His name is Sinestro.


00:49:47.793 --> 00:49:50.379
He's a Green Lantern
who went rogue.


00:49:52.131 --> 00:49:56.135
If by "went rogue" you mean I
saw through the Guardian's lies,


00:49:56.218 --> 00:50:01.725
then yes, I've embraced the power
of yellow energy and gone rogue.


00:50:02.475 --> 00:50:05.395
The color yellow is the one thing
your ring power is useless against.


00:50:05.478 --> 00:50:07.480
Yeah, the ring told me.


00:50:07.564 --> 00:50:11.317
But I've been up against that
kind of barrier my whole life.


00:50:12.318 --> 00:50:14.403
It hasn't stopped me yet.


00:50:14.486 --> 00:50:16.530
Why don't you just kill us?


00:50:17.823 --> 00:50:20.075
Because I may have
a use for you.


00:50:21.076 --> 00:50:24.913
But don't worry, your
death is a viable option.


00:50:26.832 --> 00:50:28.083
We could dig our way out.


00:50:28.167 --> 00:50:29.752
Good thing I've
got a head start.


00:50:35.090 --> 00:50:36.090
Hal!


00:50:37.425 --> 00:50:39.594
I knew you were alive!
You're too stubborn to die!


00:50:39.677 --> 00:50:41.929
You're a sight for
sore eyes, Ollie.


00:50:42.013 --> 00:50:43.097
What are you doing here?


00:50:43.181 --> 00:50:45.850
We came looking for you after
your ring turned up on his finger.


00:50:45.933 --> 00:50:47.643
His name's John Stewart.


00:50:50.856 --> 00:50:54.068
And this is Shayera
and Adam Strange.


00:50:54.526 --> 00:50:56.028
The Rannian hero?


00:50:56.111 --> 00:50:58.530
I wish we were meeting
under better circumstances.


00:50:58.989 --> 00:51:00.199
So do I.


00:51:00.823 --> 00:51:03.659
Apparently, your ring was
given to John by a Guardian.


00:51:04.202 --> 00:51:06.371
So... you received my ring.


00:51:07.163 --> 00:51:08.081
From what I heard,


00:51:08.164 --> 00:51:11.626
they screwed up big-time by
choosing me as your replacement.


00:51:12.293 --> 00:51:14.212
Oh, the Guardians
don't make mistakes


00:51:14.295 --> 00:51:16.015
when it comes to
appointing a Green Lantern.


00:51:17.048 --> 00:51:18.716
They've been doing it
for a million years.


00:51:19.384 --> 00:51:21.135
They won't be doing it anymore.


00:51:22.387 --> 00:51:23.805
Oa has been destroyed.


00:51:24.722 --> 00:51:26.390
The Guardians are dead.


00:51:31.895 --> 00:51:32.938
Sinestro.


00:51:34.398 --> 00:51:38.736
We think he disguised his ship as
a Rannian vessel and attacked them.


00:51:39.570 --> 00:51:40.738
He's done even worse.


00:51:41.531 --> 00:51:43.825
He sabotaged Sardath's
grand experiment.


00:51:45.326 --> 00:51:46.828
So he started the war?


00:51:48.287 --> 00:51:49.664
Why would he do that?


00:51:50.498 --> 00:51:51.748
Because he's insane!


00:51:52.916 --> 00:51:55.335
Sinestro thrives
on chaos and death.


00:51:55.419 --> 00:51:58.088
Sure, I get that. But
how did you end up here?


00:51:59.339 --> 00:52:01.675
And how did your
ring end up with me?


00:52:02.342 --> 00:52:05.262
I was told rings only leave
Lanterns after they die.


00:52:06.847 --> 00:52:08.014
Good questions.


00:52:08.098 --> 00:52:11.268
I'll give you the quick
and dirty explanation...


00:52:12.269 --> 00:52:14.771
<i>I was asked to keep watch
on Sardath's experiment.</i>


00:52:14.855 --> 00:52:17.148
<i>And while I was outside
with the science barge...</i>


00:52:17.940 --> 00:52:20.860
<i>Sinestro infiltrated the base.</i>


00:52:25.072 --> 00:52:27.116
<i>The experiment went
out of control.</i>


00:52:29.953 --> 00:52:32.956
<i>I was pulled onto the planet before
it teleported with everyone else.</i>


00:52:45.301 --> 00:52:46.552
<i>Before I passed out,</i>


00:52:46.635 --> 00:52:49.221
<i>I released my ring so
Sinestro couldn't get it.</i>


00:52:58.981 --> 00:52:59.982
<i>When I came to...</i>


00:53:01.066 --> 00:53:04.320
I was here. And I've
been here ever since.


00:53:05.488 --> 00:53:06.988
As for my ring...


00:53:07.071 --> 00:53:09.616
Well, It must have been found
by the Guardians and they,


00:53:09.699 --> 00:53:10.950
in their wisdom,


00:53:11.034 --> 00:53:13.244
chose to reassign it
to a worthy candidate.


00:53:14.412 --> 00:53:16.414
I'll be happy to
give it back to you.


00:53:16.498 --> 00:53:18.666
If I ever get it back, that is.


00:53:20.669 --> 00:53:21.921
We've gotta escape.


00:53:22.963 --> 00:53:25.257
Right. To stop Sinestro.


00:53:25.341 --> 00:53:27.927
Odd as this is, Sinestro
is problem number two.


00:53:28.010 --> 00:53:29.845
First we've got to get to Rann


00:53:29.929 --> 00:53:33.181
and stop Sardath from using his new
Doomsday Weapon to destroy Thanagar.


00:53:34.349 --> 00:53:35.558
Doomsday Weapon?


00:53:36.351 --> 00:53:39.437
Sardath is going to use
Zeta-Beams as a mega-weapon.


00:53:39.521 --> 00:53:41.856
He's trying it out
in a secret location.


00:53:41.940 --> 00:53:44.025
Only the Rannian High
Command knows where.


00:53:45.193 --> 00:53:46.194
Really...


00:53:49.781 --> 00:53:52.283
Thank you for all
that information.


00:53:52.367 --> 00:53:54.953
See? You were useful after all.


00:53:55.870 --> 00:53:57.955
You should be proud.


00:53:58.455 --> 00:54:00.123
You'll never get
your hands on it.


00:54:00.207 --> 00:54:03.043
No matter how much of an
assault you launch on Rann.


00:54:03.126 --> 00:54:04.628
Their defenses are too good.


00:54:04.711 --> 00:54:06.004
An assault on Rann


00:54:06.088 --> 00:54:08.298
to find the location of
their Doomsday Weapon?


00:54:10.134 --> 00:54:11.719
What a splendid idea!


00:54:11.803 --> 00:54:13.638
I'll get on that right away!


00:54:19.143 --> 00:54:21.645
We really suck at
being covert operators.


00:54:21.728 --> 00:54:24.648
Jordan, you said you were
on the verge of escaping.


00:54:24.731 --> 00:54:25.732
How?


00:54:27.150 --> 00:54:28.318
I've been digging.


00:54:28.402 --> 00:54:30.487
Judging from the warmer
temperature of the rock,


00:54:30.571 --> 00:54:32.614
I think the controls
for the force field door


00:54:32.698 --> 00:54:34.992
are powered by conduits
running through here.


00:54:35.075 --> 00:54:36.577
If I can just get to them...


00:54:36.660 --> 00:54:39.913
We turn off the force field by
short-circuiting its power feed!


00:54:40.497 --> 00:54:41.498
I'm almost there.


00:54:41.582 --> 00:54:43.667
But it's another foot of
rock to grind through.


00:54:45.836 --> 00:54:47.587
Would an Nth metal knife help?


00:54:50.298 --> 00:54:52.425
The hardest substance
in the universe?


00:54:52.508 --> 00:54:54.677
Yeah, might come in handy.


00:55:21.287 --> 00:55:23.956
Lord Damyn, Lyssa,
ready the ship at once.


00:55:24.707 --> 00:55:26.709
Dress it as a
Thanagarian cruiser.


00:55:27.668 --> 00:55:29.962
They're working
on it as we speak.


00:55:30.880 --> 00:55:34.467
Excellent. Rann will
never expect an attack.


00:55:35.593 --> 00:55:38.637
The element of surprise should
yield a fruitful result.


00:56:11.753 --> 00:56:13.338
He has my mace.


00:56:13.421 --> 00:56:15.590
How rude. Allow me.


00:56:42.951 --> 00:56:43.952
He's dead.


00:56:44.869 --> 00:56:45.954
Serves him right.


00:56:46.871 --> 00:56:49.040
I've never known you to
be indifferent to death.


00:56:50.375 --> 00:56:53.711
Yeah well, months of being brutalized
in captivity will do that to a man.


00:56:57.131 --> 00:56:58.966
And millions of
lives are at stake.


00:57:00.259 --> 00:57:02.459
Let's get out of here before
the others leave that ship.


00:57:09.476 --> 00:57:10.561
I'll fire up the engines.


00:57:10.644 --> 00:57:11.478
Wait.


00:57:11.562 --> 00:57:14.064
We need to get the ring.
The Green Lantern ring.


00:57:14.606 --> 00:57:15.667
What? Come on. All you've done


00:57:15.691 --> 00:57:17.442
is complain about it
and now you want it?


00:57:18.025 --> 00:57:20.653
Between Hal and me, one
of us should have it.


00:57:20.737 --> 00:57:23.489
We're going into battle.
We might need it.


00:57:24.574 --> 00:57:26.135
We don't have time to
go back and get it.


00:57:26.159 --> 00:57:27.160
Not necessary.


00:57:27.243 --> 00:57:29.830
All John has to do
is will it to come.


00:57:29.913 --> 00:57:31.749
It doesn't matter
where the ring is.


00:57:33.000 --> 00:57:34.835
It'll find a way to get to him.


00:57:34.918 --> 00:57:37.421
Close your eyes
and will it back.


00:57:37.504 --> 00:57:38.964
But it's your ring.


00:57:39.047 --> 00:57:40.340
Not anymore.


00:57:40.424 --> 00:57:41.842
It answers to you now.


00:57:42.550 --> 00:57:44.427
Close your eyes. Summon it!


00:57:44.510 --> 00:57:47.513
Yeah, and Sinestro probably put
it with all of our other weapons.


00:57:47.597 --> 00:57:49.599
See if you can
grab those up, too!


00:58:33.892 --> 00:58:35.977
What? No! The ring!


00:58:36.561 --> 00:58:37.646
Get it! Get it!


00:58:54.371 --> 00:58:55.371
What?


00:58:56.498 --> 00:58:59.250
Ring, do we have enough fuel
to make a jump to warp speed?


00:59:00.501 --> 00:59:01.585
<i>Inconclusive.</i>


00:59:02.419 --> 00:59:04.839
That's wonderful.
Strap in, everybody.


00:59:12.681 --> 00:59:15.308
This ship needs several
months in space dock.


00:59:15.392 --> 00:59:18.770
Hull integrity diminishing.
Breach in five seconds.


00:59:18.854 --> 00:59:20.814
I'm dropping us
out of warp speed.


00:59:24.191 --> 00:59:25.943
We still have a long way to go.


00:59:26.026 --> 00:59:28.362
Well, I'll drive as fast as
I can without the hyperdrive.


00:59:39.540 --> 00:59:42.793
Sinestro beat us to
Rann! What do we do now?


00:59:46.297 --> 00:59:49.299
<i>Adam Strange calling
Rannian High Command.</i>


00:59:49.382 --> 00:59:50.884
Is this some kind of trick?


00:59:50.967 --> 00:59:52.468
Commander Strange
is no longer...


00:59:52.552 --> 00:59:55.555
<i>Jorson? Is that you? It's Adam.</i>


00:59:55.638 --> 00:59:57.891
<i>Are you still
terrible at Jaccarat?</i>


01:00:03.063 --> 01:00:05.399
By her Lady's Grace, it is you!


01:00:06.400 --> 01:00:08.652
Open a window in the shield
for us to get through.


01:00:08.736 --> 01:00:10.613
I'll explain everything
when I see you.


01:00:10.696 --> 01:00:12.323
<i>Sending you coordinates now.</i>


01:00:12.406 --> 01:00:14.407
<i>The window will open
for two seconds.</i>


01:00:15.241 --> 01:00:16.534
That's all we need.


01:00:29.631 --> 01:00:31.007
Annihilate them.


01:00:42.351 --> 01:00:43.936
We've got company.


01:01:07.709 --> 01:01:10.504
Hmm. As I live and breathe.


01:01:10.587 --> 01:01:12.881
I never thought I'd
lay eyes on you again.


01:01:12.965 --> 01:01:14.299
It's good to be back.


01:01:15.759 --> 01:01:19.221
I'm sorry the circumstances of
your homecoming are so grim.


01:01:19.304 --> 01:01:22.975
I have no idea why these Thanagarians
have launched this futile attack.


01:01:23.058 --> 01:01:24.476
They're not Thanagarians.


01:01:26.728 --> 01:01:29.480
What nonsense is your
prisoner speaking?


01:01:29.563 --> 01:01:31.732
I am not a prisoner!


01:01:32.316 --> 01:01:34.318
She's not and she's right.


01:01:34.402 --> 01:01:36.904
We've uncovered a plot
by a band of rogue agents


01:01:36.988 --> 01:01:39.824
to start and keep this war
going between our worlds.


01:01:39.907 --> 01:01:41.994
They're the ones
firing on you now!


01:01:42.077 --> 01:01:45.330
That ship is not
Thanagarian. It's disguised.


01:01:45.414 --> 01:01:46.999
We never thought to check.


01:01:47.082 --> 01:01:49.126
But if what you say is true...


01:01:49.209 --> 01:01:51.253
We know about the secret weapon.


01:01:51.336 --> 01:01:54.505
We have to stop Sardath
from using it on Thanagar.


01:01:54.588 --> 01:01:56.757
And I need your
help to contact him.


01:01:58.843 --> 01:02:01.512
Adam? Is it really you!?


01:02:02.179 --> 01:02:04.515
<i>Yes. I have to see you at once.</i>


01:02:04.598 --> 01:02:06.267
<i>Don't deploy your weapon.</i>


01:02:06.350 --> 01:02:07.435
How do you know about...


01:02:07.518 --> 01:02:09.186
<i>Billions of innocent
lives are art stake.</i>


01:02:09.270 --> 01:02:11.022
<i>It can't be used!</i>


01:02:11.689 --> 01:02:13.232
But my weapon is the only thing


01:02:13.315 --> 01:02:16.610
that will stop the Thanagarians
from killing more of us.


01:02:16.694 --> 01:02:19.696
And I have you to
thank for its creation.


01:02:20.280 --> 01:02:21.197
<i>Me?</i>


01:02:21.281 --> 01:02:24.034
It was the analysis
of your unique biology


01:02:24.117 --> 01:02:26.953
that made it possible to
isolate your metagene.


01:02:27.037 --> 01:02:28.038
<i>Metagene?</i>


01:02:28.705 --> 01:02:31.876
I knew Zeta energy
always found you,


01:02:31.959 --> 01:02:33.627
as though drawn to you.


01:02:33.711 --> 01:02:37.298
I noticed that you were
born with a unique metagene


01:02:37.381 --> 01:02:39.550
and that was my
first breakthrough.


01:02:40.885 --> 01:02:44.554
<i>I gained some control over
where the Zeta-Beams went.</i>


01:02:48.224 --> 01:02:52.270
<i>Eventually, I was able to
amplify the phenomenon.</i>


01:02:58.735 --> 01:03:03.406
<i>Now, I command vast amounts
of Zeta energy at will!</i>


01:03:06.826 --> 01:03:09.078
<i>We've begun building
a charge large enough</i>


01:03:09.161 --> 01:03:11.830
<i>to teleport Thanagar
into a supernova!</i>


01:03:14.416 --> 01:03:16.335
Rann will be forever safe!


01:03:17.169 --> 01:03:18.921
<i>I beg you not to use it.</i>


01:03:19.004 --> 01:03:20.840
<i>You'll be murdering innocents.</i>


01:03:20.924 --> 01:03:23.927
I'm shocked to hear
such cowardice from you,


01:03:24.010 --> 01:03:26.721
especially since
Thanagar was responsible


01:03:26.805 --> 01:03:30.433
for the death of your wife,
my beloved daughter, Alanna.


01:03:31.434 --> 01:03:32.852
<i>If Alanna were alive,</i>


01:03:32.936 --> 01:03:34.186
<i>she'd be ashamed to learn</i>


01:03:34.269 --> 01:03:36.939
<i>that instead of trying to
find our daughter Aleea,</i>


01:03:37.022 --> 01:03:40.526
<i>you've been using your time
figuring out how to kill billions!</i>


01:03:40.609 --> 01:03:41.693
How dare you!?


01:03:42.486 --> 01:03:45.614
<i>Thanagar nor Rann started
this war and I can prove it.</i>


01:03:45.697 --> 01:03:49.201
<i>But I'll have to see you face-to-face
to show you the evidence.</i>


01:03:49.284 --> 01:03:50.953
I can't do that.


01:03:51.036 --> 01:03:54.456
My location is a secret of
the greatest importance,


01:03:54.540 --> 01:03:58.876
too sensitive to transmit,
even over a secure line.


01:03:58.960 --> 01:04:02.630
But I can use a Zeta-Beam
to transport you here.


01:04:05.633 --> 01:04:07.802
<i>Fine. There are five of us.</i>


01:04:28.156 --> 01:04:30.658
Don't like that
transporter stuff one bit.


01:04:33.578 --> 01:04:35.788
Sardath, in memory of Alanna,


01:04:35.872 --> 01:04:39.333
I'm here to prevent you from
making a terrible mistake.


01:04:39.417 --> 01:04:41.961
Your first Zeta
experiment was sabotaged.


01:04:42.044 --> 01:04:43.671
It caused this war!


01:04:46.257 --> 01:04:47.758
What are you talking about?


01:04:53.305 --> 01:04:55.849
<i>We're being approached by
a Thanagarian attack ship!</i>


01:05:01.689 --> 01:05:04.025
Sinestro! How did
he follow us here?


01:05:04.108 --> 01:05:05.860
Doesn't matter. Get
ready for a fight.


01:07:19.406 --> 01:07:20.490
Hal!?


01:07:26.330 --> 01:07:27.914
No time to be soft, pal.


01:08:09.538 --> 01:08:11.957
Now I'll have the sheer delight


01:08:12.041 --> 01:08:15.211
of destroying the last
of the Green Lanterns.


01:08:58.504 --> 01:08:59.754
Damn you.


01:09:00.755 --> 01:09:02.590
You gave me no choice.


01:09:04.259 --> 01:09:08.847
My master will kill you all!


01:09:48.887 --> 01:09:50.471
Shot from behind.


01:10:59.039 --> 01:10:59.957
Come on!


01:11:00.040 --> 01:11:02.376
We've got to get to Sardath
before he uses the Weapon.


01:11:10.758 --> 01:11:13.553
Good news. Sardath isn't
going to use the weapon.


01:11:14.345 --> 01:11:15.972
He's handing over the CPU


01:11:16.055 --> 01:11:19.058
containing the core of
his Zeta technology to me.


01:11:19.141 --> 01:11:21.894
The code is downloading
to this storage unit.


01:11:23.145 --> 01:11:27.650
The only other place where this
knowledge is stored is my mind.


01:11:28.401 --> 01:11:29.652
Excellent.


01:11:32.571 --> 01:11:35.073
Hal! What have you done?


01:11:38.493 --> 01:11:40.078
What was necessary!


01:11:41.496 --> 01:11:44.250
But there's still a
lot of work to be done.


01:11:59.931 --> 01:12:02.684
Oh, you'll have to
do better than that.


01:12:04.686 --> 01:12:06.521
Hal, what's wrong with you?


01:12:07.522 --> 01:12:10.525
We had it all backwards. He
wasn't Sinestro's prisoner.


01:12:10.609 --> 01:12:12.527
Hal was his master!


01:12:13.737 --> 01:12:16.448
Right you are,
John. Right you are.


01:12:16.531 --> 01:12:19.117
I have him to thank
for my transformation.


01:12:20.868 --> 01:12:25.205
He was the stepping stone so I
could fulfill my true calling...


01:12:30.252 --> 01:12:31.629
with these!


01:12:53.525 --> 01:12:55.653
<i>After the experiment
went haywire,</i>


01:12:55.736 --> 01:12:58.530
<i>Sinestro infected me
with an alien parasite.</i>


01:13:00.407 --> 01:13:02.910
<i>He called it the
Parallax entity!</i>


01:13:08.999 --> 01:13:10.792
<i>He thought it would
bend me to his will.</i>


01:13:20.677 --> 01:13:23.722
<i>But instead, it opened my eyes.</i>


01:13:27.935 --> 01:13:30.187
<i>It filled me with new purpose.</i>


01:13:30.270 --> 01:13:31.939
<i>For too long, I had been blind</i>


01:13:32.022 --> 01:13:35.608
<i>to the corrosive effect
of war and conflict.</i>


01:14:00.133 --> 01:14:03.885
<i>I saw clearly that I was the
one destined to change it!</i>


01:14:04.886 --> 01:14:07.889
<i>I could be a better
Guardian than the Guardians.</i>


01:14:10.142 --> 01:14:11.810
<i>There was no use
for them anymore.</i>


01:14:21.070 --> 01:14:23.865
<i>After Sinestro saw
my truth and genius,</i>


01:14:23.948 --> 01:14:26.241
<i>he became my main acolyte.</i>


01:14:43.425 --> 01:14:47.345
With this weapon, I can
fulfill my true purpose.


01:14:47.429 --> 01:14:51.932
I can wipe the universe clean
and create a newer, better one...


01:14:52.016 --> 01:14:53.684
Like a God!


01:15:46.736 --> 01:15:48.947
Go. We'll be fine.


01:16:18.351 --> 01:16:22.188
I've set the Zeta-Beam to
destroy both Rann and Thanagar.


01:16:24.107 --> 01:16:29.112
Make the choice and join me in
making a new and better galaxy.


01:16:30.780 --> 01:16:33.949
My only choice is to
stop you or die trying.


01:16:56.180 --> 01:16:59.391
Hal! This isn't you!


01:17:01.977 --> 01:17:03.145
You're right.


01:17:03.228 --> 01:17:06.189
The old me would continue a
useless fight against evil


01:17:06.273 --> 01:17:07.482
as a Green Lantern.


01:17:10.652 --> 01:17:13.280
But the new me is a god.


01:17:17.492 --> 01:17:19.411
And I thought you
were my friend.


01:17:20.495 --> 01:17:22.079
I am your friend, Hal.


01:17:22.163 --> 01:17:24.665
Just listen to me and
stop this madness!


01:17:33.299 --> 01:17:34.801
Try to stop the Zeta-Beam!


01:17:40.849 --> 01:17:42.017
Why fight me?


01:17:42.100 --> 01:17:45.604
Aren't I doing exactly what
you'd do if you were in my place?


01:17:45.687 --> 01:17:48.022
I can see it in your eyes.


01:17:48.105 --> 01:17:51.275
You hate what the universe
has become as much as I do.


01:17:53.027 --> 01:17:54.737
No, you're wrong.


01:18:29.063 --> 01:18:32.483
It's locked. We'll never
get through on time.


01:18:33.484 --> 01:18:35.152
Maybe John could use his ring.


01:18:35.820 --> 01:18:39.906
No. It would take a billion rings
to put a dent in the Zeta force.


01:18:39.990 --> 01:18:41.324
It can't be stopped.


01:18:42.158 --> 01:18:44.077
But maybe it can be re-directed.


01:18:44.160 --> 01:18:45.286
What are you saying?


01:18:46.246 --> 01:18:49.916
Shayera, keep an eye on the
Universe for me while I'm gone.


01:19:03.595 --> 01:19:05.848
You've made me realize
the Green Lantern oath


01:19:05.931 --> 01:19:08.183
isn't just some silly rhyme.


01:19:10.185 --> 01:19:12.438
It means something after all.


01:19:14.148 --> 01:19:15.442
"In brightest day,


01:19:18.153 --> 01:19:19.779
in blackest night,


01:19:20.530 --> 01:19:23.283
no evil shall escape my sight.


01:19:23.783 --> 01:19:25.827
Let those who
worship evil's might


01:19:27.161 --> 01:19:28.746
beware my power...


01:19:30.039 --> 01:19:31.874
Green Lantern's light."


01:19:45.888 --> 01:19:47.014
What's happening?


01:19:51.393 --> 01:19:53.728
I've finally
remembered why I fight.


01:19:58.149 --> 01:19:59.149
No!


01:20:02.153 --> 01:20:06.742
And why, whatever price I
have to pay, I'm okay with it.


01:20:15.876 --> 01:20:17.919
Maybe the Guardians
made the right choice


01:20:18.002 --> 01:20:19.754
by making me a Green Lantern.


01:20:28.429 --> 01:20:31.015
But killing you isn't the way.


01:20:31.099 --> 01:20:33.851
John, the beam's locked in.


01:20:34.685 --> 01:20:36.604
We've tried everything
we can think of.


01:20:36.687 --> 01:20:38.606
But we cannot stop it from here.


01:20:46.696 --> 01:20:50.617
John, you're too
soft to be a Lantern.


01:21:30.490 --> 01:21:32.491
You're too late.


01:21:45.255 --> 01:21:46.255
Look!


01:22:03.522 --> 01:22:04.899
For you Alanna.


01:22:18.704 --> 01:22:21.790
For a Rannian, he
was very brave.


01:22:25.376 --> 01:22:28.213
Thanks for saving my life.


01:22:30.506 --> 01:22:32.425
I had to kill my best friend.


01:22:34.969 --> 01:22:36.889
I don't know how I'm
supposed to live with that.


01:22:39.099 --> 01:22:41.894
We're all forced to do
things we don't want to.


01:22:41.977 --> 01:22:44.230
We can't beat
ourselves up over it,


01:22:45.481 --> 01:22:47.899
as long as we do them
for the right reasons.


01:23:28.606 --> 01:23:30.191
Thanks for the ride, Shayera.


01:23:31.526 --> 01:23:33.778
Now, there's just one
more thing left to do.


01:23:34.862 --> 01:23:37.031
Rebuild the Green Lantern Corps.


01:23:51.295 --> 01:23:53.213
I hope to see you
soon, John Stewart.


01:23:54.798 --> 01:23:57.634
Thanagar will need a Green
Lantern to help watch over it.


01:24:28.664 --> 01:24:30.249
Congratulations, hero.


01:24:30.333 --> 01:24:31.834
You're a Green Lantern.


01:24:32.501 --> 01:24:33.502
How's it feel?


01:24:33.586 --> 01:24:34.587
I'm starving.


01:24:35.671 --> 01:24:39.258
Let's get something to eat
and toast our absent friends.


01:24:40.426 --> 01:24:41.844
And maybe a few new ones.

